id=liuqin_boot_ubuntu
name=Boot to Ubuntu (liuqin)
version=v0.2
versionCode=2
author=xiaomipad-6pro-mainline
description=One button that makes slot B (mainline Ubuntu) the active boot slot and restarts the tablet, and a boot-time guard that disables the Android system updater so that an OTA cannot overwrite slot B. Android always lives in slot A on this device.
